[node name="StationZenithPort" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "The Space Station's zenith (space-facing) docking port on top of the Harmony module, for the Docking Trainer (res://scenes/docking.tscn). The docking plane is at the origin and the port faces +Y (straight up, away from Earth). Sizes in meters: the IDA soft-capture ring, PMA-3 and Harmony, with the station model around it."

